{"id":"f12a7a1ec4908770","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-substitution-functor.md","title":"选定提升给出的重索引","display":"df-substitution-functor — 选定提升给出的重索引","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-substitution-functor","aliases":["16-df-substitution-functor","16-substitution-functor"],"display":"df-substitution-functor — 选定提升给出的重索引","depends_on":["[[16-df-cleavage]]","[[16-df-functor]]"],"source":"§1.4, pp. 47–48 (PDF 67–68)","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-substitution-functor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-substitution-functor</span><span>16-substitution-functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution-functor — 选定提升给出的重索引"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§1.4, pp. 47–48 (PDF 67–68)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 具有 cleavage <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k:Y\\to Y&#39;\">\\(k:Y\\to Y&#39;\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_J\">\\(\\mathcal E_J\\)</span> 中的垂直箭头。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*Y\">\\(u^*Y\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*k\">\\(u^*k\\)</span> 分别简写该函子记录的对象分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(u^*)_0(Y)\">\\((u^*)_0(Y)\\)</span> 与箭头分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(u^*)_1(k)\">\\((u^*)_1(k)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(u^*)_0(Y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}\\kappa(u,Y),\\\\\n\\{(u^*)_1(k)\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{h\\in\\mathcal E_I((u^*)_0Y,(u^*)_0Y&#39;)\\mid\\kappa(u,Y&#39;)h=k\\kappa(u,Y)\\},\\\\\nu^*&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(u^*)_0,(u^*)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(u^*,\\mathcal E_J,\\mathcal E_I)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(u^*)_0(Y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}\\kappa(u,Y),\\\\\n\\{(u^*)_1(k)\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{h\\in\\mathcal E_I((u^*)_0Y,(u^*)_0Y&#39;)\\mid\\kappa(u,Y&#39;)h=k\\kappa(u,Y)\\},\\\\\nu^*&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(u^*)_0,(u^*)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(u^*,\\mathcal E_J,\\mathcal E_I)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>右侧集合由笛卡尔泛性质是单元素集合，故定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*k\">\\(u^*k\\)</span>。对恒等及复合代入此等式，唯一性给出函子定律。</li>\n<li>该形式取代原公式中的英文 “the unique … such that …”，同时写明箭头所在纤维。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，§1.4, pp. 47–48 (PDF 67–68)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cleavage]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p$ 具有 cleavage $\\kappa$，见 [[16-df-cleavage]]；$u:I\\to J$，$k:Y\\to Y'$ 是 $\\mathcal E_J$ 中的垂直箭头。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-functor]]。$u^*Y$、$u^*k$ 分别简写该函子记录的对象分量 $(u^*)_0(Y)$ 与箭头分量 $(u^*)_1(k)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"k:Y\\to Y'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"u^*Y","display":false},{"tex":"u^*k","display":false},{"tex":"(u^*)_0(Y)","display":false},{"tex":"(u^*)_1(k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(u^*)_0(Y)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}\\kappa(u,Y),\\\\\n\\{(u^*)_1(k)\\}&\\coloneqq\n\\{h\\in\\mathcal E_I((u^*)_0Y,(u^*)_0Y')\\mid\\kappa(u,Y')h=k\\kappa(u,Y)\\},\\\\\nu^*&\\coloneqq\\langle(u^*)_0,(u^*)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(u^*,\\mathcal E_J,\\mathcal E_I)&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"u^*k","display":false}],"bytes":1427,"backlinks":[{"id":"d8e49782eb81e5ab","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$。$u^*$、$i_{I,X}$、$c_{u,v,Z}$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution-functor]]、[[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]。"},{"id":"289eaf1d577b4823","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$；$u^*$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution-functor]]。$c_{a,b,X}:a^*b^*X\\to(ba)^*X$ 采用 [[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]] 的规范相干同构。"},{"id":"3af0cd796b55bbd7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$u^*Y$、$u^*g$、函子 $u^*$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution-functor]] 的唯一构造；$Y,Z\\in\\mathcal E_J$、$g\\in\\mathcal E_J(Y,Z)$。$\\bar u_Y,\\bar u_Z$ 是下式定义的旧记号。"},{"id":"327b5aca93ba8aef","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$，$I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$；纤维与重索引采用 [[16-df-cleavage]]、[[16-df-substitution-functor]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-353","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-substitution-functor|df-substitution-functor — 选定提升给出的重索引]]"},{"id":"fe8616bdebd0be49","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$u^*$ 是同一 $\\kappa$ 按 [[16-df-substitution-functor]] 构造的重索引函子。$I,J,K,L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$，$u:I\\to J$、$v:L\\to K$ 是基箭头。对 $X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E$，记 $I=pX$；对 $f\\in\\mathcal E(X,Y)$，另记 $J=pY$、$u=pf$。$f^v$ 在 Assertion 中由唯一描述定义。"},{"id":"298460dd9013dccf","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$；$u^*$ 为 [[16-df-substitution-functor]] 的重索引函子。"}],"outgoing":["4ea27d39c2af987b","fc49efccd7348d66"]}